  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestinan programme for transfers to municipalities, for investments in municipal services and capacity and institutional development.      Expected to result in improved local governance and accountability   and in better municipal service provision, and a major step forward   in harmonising donor inputs to the municipal sector .</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Palestinskt program f&#xf6;r transfereringar till kommuner, f&#xf6;r            investeringar i kommunal service samt kapacitets- och                 institutionsutveckling.F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas bidra till b&#xf6;t&#xe4;ttre kommunal         f&#xf6;rvaltning, med mer insyn och reviderbarhet. &#xc4;r ocks&#xe5; ett steg mot   &#xf6;kad harmonisering av givarst&#xf6;d till kommuner/lokala myndigheter</narrative>
  </description>
